(6784243, 1014604, 137320, '<td valign="top">Wow! There is so much I could say about this image. I''ll just say I stared at it for quite some time...it''s the type of image that deserves it! Love the processing on it also. The tones really take the shot to the next level.</td>', 'Wow! There is so much I could say about this image. I''ll just say I stared at it for quite some time...it''s the type of image that deserves it! Love the processing on it also. The tones really take the shot to the next level.', '2012-06-02 18:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
