(6784500, 1017934, 29777, '<td valign="top">The square crop does not help this image. My eye wanders around and keeps settling on the bright area that is the person in the rear on the left. It appears that you wanted to freeze the action of the players, but many elements show motion blur. I would suggest making things sharp or very blurry to show intent in the image.</td>', 'The square crop does not help this image. My eye wanders around and keeps settling on the bright area that is the person in the rear on the left. It appears that you wanted to freeze the action of the players, but many elements show motion blur. I would suggest making things sharp or very blurry to show intent in the image.', '2012-06-03 04:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6784502, 1018445, 29777, '<td valign="top">I would suggest tilting the shot more or making the horizon level. This is a cool shot but it is unsettling due to the slight tilt to the right.</td>', 'I would suggest tilting the shot more or making the horizon level. This is a cool shot but it is unsettling due to the slight tilt to the right.', '2012-06-03 04:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
