(6784516, 1018449, 142363, '<td valign="top">I keep getting sincerely distracted by his thumb nail, which is grossing me out a little.  It pulls my focus away from the ring, which should be the highlight of the photo, yes?  I''m not judging - trust me, I can show you my nails, but it''s something that can be easily hidden by a slightly different pose - putting focus back on the ring and her absolutely lovely hand/skin.</td>', 'I keep getting sincerely distracted by his thumb nail, which is grossing me out a little.  It pulls my focus away from the ring, which should be the highlight of the photo, yes?  I''m not judging - trust me, I can show you my nails, but it''s something that can be easily hidden by a slightly different pose - putting focus back on the ring and her absolutely lovely hand/skin.', '2012-06-03 06:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
