(6786223, 1017007, 34547, '<td valign="top">The infrared doesn''t do a lot for me in this photo, however, it does add to the overall attention to detail in the shot. It is clear that you were conscious of the important lines and negative space.</td>', 'The infrared doesn''t do a lot for me in this photo, however, it does add to the overall attention to detail in the shot. It is clear that you were conscious of the important lines and negative space.', '2012-06-05 06:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
