(6786298, 1014647, 138253, '<td valign="top">The narrow DoF band in the middle here feels awkward, especially with the "floating" blue box feeling as if it was haphazardly inserted after the fact.<br/> <br/>I''d have marked this higher if you had the tight DoF in the foreground or even possibly the background, but not in the middle area like this.</td>', 'The narrow DoF band in the middle here feels awkward, especially with the "floating" blue box feeling as if it was haphazardly inserted after the fact. I''d have marked this higher if you had the tight DoF in the foreground or even possibly the background, but not in the middle area like this.', '2012-06-05 09:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
