(6786303, 1014732, 138253, '<td valign="top">i''m torn. i like the picture but i do not like the washed out feeling. but then i wonder if it would just feel ''snap shot-y'' without the wash out and i can''t decide. <br/> <br/>i think it''s the clouds that i like the most in the background here with the building, it''s the washed out fields that just aren''t doing anything for me.<br/> <br/>i especially like how i see a cranky old man with squinted eyes, a big nose and ear and a pursed mouth in the top left cloud. it''s like he''s scowling at the serene view in front of him.</td>', 'i''m torn. i like the picture but i do not like the washed out feeling. but then i wonder if it would just feel ''snap shot-y'' without the wash out and i can''t decide.  i think it''s the clouds that i like the most in the background here with the building, it''s the washed out fields that just aren''t doing anything for me. i especially like how i see a cranky old man with squinted eyes, a big nose and ear and a pursed mouth in the top left cloud. it''s like he''s scowling at the serene view in front of him.', '2012-06-05 10:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
