(6787823, 1017792, 54778, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait. I''m glad you chose not to go the b/w route because the colours are lovely. I think my only criticism is that the blue is reflecting on the subject too much (like the face is blue tinged and so are the clothes). I think a little more work on getting that blue tone off the subject and the image would be perfect</td>', 'Beautiful portrait. I''m glad you chose not to go the b/w route because the colours are lovely. I think my only criticism is that the blue is reflecting on the subject too much (like the face is blue tinged and so are the clothes). I think a little more work on getting that blue tone off the subject and the image would be perfect', '2012-06-06 14:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6787829, 1017482, 54778, '<td valign="top">wow! The colours are magical. Only criticism is that maybe the light bulbs on the left take off the attention from the ceiling.</td>', 'wow! The colours are magical. Only criticism is that maybe the light bulbs on the left take off the attention from the ceiling.', '2012-06-06 14:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
