(6787844, 1017947, 54778, '<td valign="top">Very pretty colours! I think my only issue is that the structure underneath looks extremely interesting but it''s underexposed in comparison to the sky and bringing it out a little would have elevated the image</td>', 'Very pretty colours! I think my only issue is that the structure underneath looks extremely interesting but it''s underexposed in comparison to the sky and bringing it out a little would have elevated the image', '2012-06-06 15:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
