(6788462, 1018681, 83313, '<td valign="top">I love the scene that has been captured, but the added shallow DOF does not come off well to me. It''s just too abrupt and doesn''t look realistic to me. My own trick for guiding the eye to my subject and minimizing background distractions is a subtle dark vignette. Not enough to scream that I used one, but just enough to help steer the viewer''s eye.</td>', 'I love the scene that has been captured, but the added shallow DOF does not come off well to me. It''s just too abrupt and doesn''t look realistic to me. My own trick for guiding the eye to my subject and minimizing background distractions is a subtle dark vignette. Not enough to scream that I used one, but just enough to help steer the viewer''s eye.', '2012-06-07 00:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
