(6789174, 1018068, 86447, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  I''ve looked at it for a while.<br/> <br/>I wish the cat were looking at us... as the man is.   He doesn''t seem evil to me... so I don''t understand the title, but I hate titles anyway.  LOL!<br/> <br/> <br/>For some reason, once my eyes found the white spots (one on each arm), my brain won''t let go of them.<br/> <br/>I''d have cloned them out.   Also... the one on his left glasses leg.<br/> <br/>But, I''m nitpicking... I TOTALLY love the darks... the bg rocks!<br/> <br/>(commenting only)</td>', 'Interesting image.  I''ve looked at it for a while. I wish the cat were looking at us... as the man is.   He doesn''t seem evil to me... so I don''t understand the title, but I hate titles anyway.  LOL!  For some reason, once my eyes found the white spots (one on each arm), my brain won''t let go of them. I''d have cloned them out.   Also... the one on his left glasses leg. But, I''m nitpicking... I TOTALLY love the darks... the bg rocks! (commenting only)', '2012-06-07 17:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
