(6790118, 1016104, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''d never have expected to see this at the top, but I''m glad it was. Odd, the details keep pulling me deeper into the scene. Awesome.</td>', 'I''d never have expected to see this at the top, but I''m glad it was. Odd, the details keep pulling me deeper into the scene. Awesome.', '2012-06-08 04:55:40.000000', NULL, 0),
