(6790474, 1014647, 47906, '<td valign="top">I was one of your 10''s, I thought this would be so much higher and suprised that it is not. Excellent use of Tilt-Shift photography.</td>', 'I was one of your 10''s, I thought this would be so much higher and suprised that it is not. Excellent use of Tilt-Shift photography.', '2012-06-08 12:00:45.000000', NULL, 0),
