(6791538, 1017541, 83313, '<td valign="top">Now that I have read your notes, there is quite a bit of irony about this shot. I guess a street photographer can''t really object to being the subject for a change. It was worth a revisit to read what you said. I''m going to go look him up online now and see some of his work.<br/> <br/>Added: Found his facebook page and I see he shared this pic of himself after you put it on Flickr. I''d take that as a win!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-06-10 15:31:43.</i></td>', 'Now that I have read your notes, there is quite a bit of irony about this shot. I guess a street photographer can''t really object to being the subject for a change. It was worth a revisit to read what you said. I''m going to go look him up online now and see some of his work. Added: Found his facebook page and I see he shared this pic of himself after you put it on Flickr. I''d take that as a win!', '2012-06-10 16:28:27.000000', '2012-06-10 16:31:43.000000', 0),
(6791543, 1017541, 141542, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> Now that I have read your notes, there is quite a bit of irony about this shot. I guess a street photographer can''t really object to being the subject for a change. It was worth a revisit to read what you said. I''m going to go look him up online now and see some of his work.<br/> <br/>Added: Found his facebook page and I see he shared this pic of himself after you put it on Flickr. I''d take that as a win! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for checking it out, Spiff, and as far as the re-share goes, it certainly made my day!</td>', 'Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: Now that I have read your notes, there is quite a bit of irony about this shot. I guess a street photographer can''t really object to being the subject for a change. It was worth a revisit to read what you said. I''m going to go look him up online now and see some of his work. Added: Found his facebook page and I see he shared this pic of himself after you put it on Flickr. I''d take that as a win!   Thanks for checking it out, Spiff, and as far as the re-share goes, it certainly made my day!', '2012-06-10 16:58:01.000000', NULL, 0),
