(6793028, 1016104, 39427, '<td valign="top">This picture is absolutely incredible, and probably one of the best I''ve seen in my time on this site.  Wish I could fave it more than once.</td>', 'This picture is absolutely incredible, and probably one of the best I''ve seen in my time on this site.  Wish I could fave it more than once.', '2012-06-12 10:51:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(6793096, 1016714, 17126, '<td valign="top">I kinda am not surprised. I haven''t participated in years, and have sense broken my habit of being allergic to blur and noise. There is a very specific kind of photograph that wins things here, and that''s not necessarily a bad thing. I learned so much in this community, but what sells in my area of photography, fashion, does not necessarily sell here. I have been a professional photographer for about 3 years now, and have been shooting fashion for maybe two years. It''s funny that there''s a comment on the sharpness - I made it more blurry on purpose. To each his own. This shot was well-received by her agency. ;)</td>', 'I kinda am not surprised. I haven''t participated in years, and have sense broken my habit of being allergic to blur and noise. There is a very specific kind of photograph that wins things here, and that''s not necessarily a bad thing. I learned so much in this community, but what sells in my area of photography, fashion, does not necessarily sell here. I have been a professional photographer for about 3 years now, and have been shooting fashion for maybe two years. It''s funny that there''s a comment on the sharpness - I made it more blurry on purpose. To each his own. This shot was well-received by her agency. ;)', '2012-06-12 13:12:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(6793967, 1017662, 11854, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the ribbon. Did you notice all three ribbons are or have birds? LOL! I was thinking, looking at this again, this is where a better camera/lens comes in handy. I could never crop that small from one of my images.</td>', 'Congrats on the ribbon. Did you notice all three ribbons are or have birds? LOL! I was thinking, looking at this again, this is where a better camera/lens comes in handy. I could never crop that small from one of my images.', '2012-06-13 09:26:08.000000', NULL, 0),
