(6961253, 1018528, 5112, '<td valign="top">I love the POV!  I also like the colours, especially in the sky.  The slight clouds add a lot of interest to the sky.  The focus seems to be strongest on the rear flower, the front flower looks slightly fuzzy in the sections closest to the viewer.  I like the almost (implied) diagonal arrangement of the elements in the photo.  I am not sure if I like the sunflares or not, they sort of work here, and yet, they grab the eye maybe just a bit too much.  There also seems to be a dark line at the left edge, esp. to the top - not sure what that is.  But, overall, an Unusual photo in many ways, quite eyecatching, strong.  I like it.</td>', 'I love the POV!  I also like the colours, especially in the sky.  The slight clouds add a lot of interest to the sky.  The focus seems to be strongest on the rear flower, the front flower looks slightly fuzzy in the sections closest to the viewer.  I like the almost (implied) diagonal arrangement of the elements in the photo.  I am not sure if I like the sunflares or not, they sort of work here, and yet, they grab the eye maybe just a bit too much.  There also seems to be a dark line at the left edge, esp. to the top - not sure what that is.  But, overall, an Unusual photo in many ways, quite eyecatching, strong.  I like it.', '2013-01-20 02:02:46.000000', NULL, 0),
